  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Line an oven-safe steamer basket with agave leaves.",
    "Place potatoes in the steamer basket and steam for 18 minutes.",
    "Heat ghee or oil in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add berbere spice, salt, and cayenne pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add pasta water and stir to create a smooth sauce.",
    "Remove potatoes from the steamer and toss with the spicy sauce.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped parsley or cilantro."
